        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump 30kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump 30kW
Extrapolated from 10 kW heat pump.;
UUID: 0270c212-7e0c-34e9-a29a-9735820fff44
The module includes (via extrapolation from 10 kW heat pump) the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials, energy and water needed for production. It includes emissions of refrigerant (R134a) during production and scrapping. A buffer heat storage is not included.
Location: Could be used for European conditions.
Technology: Extrapolated from brine-water heat pump, 10kW output. Refrigerant R134a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0270c212-7e0c-34e9-a29a-9735820fff44.xml</text>
